# Loaded by Vite for `npm run build` (mode=production).
#
# A DEFAULT, not a lock: a VITE_API_URL set in the host's environment (Vercel,
# CI) takes precedence over this file. It exists so that a deploy which forgets
# to set it still points somewhere real, instead of baking in localhost and
# telling every phone to call itself.
#
# Only put PUBLIC values here. This file is committed. The Groq key and
# anything else secret belong in the host's environment, never in the repo.
VITE_API_URL=https://notes-app-2cur.onrender.com
